{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "marimo-intro",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# A reactive notebook\n",
        "\n",
        "Run the first cell, then change `price` and run it again: the cells that\n",
        "read `price` — `total`, then the summary — run again on their own, in\n",
        "dependency order. Marimo works the graph out from the source; the kernel\n",
        "is a plain IPython kernel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "marimo-price",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": ["price = 10\n", "quantity = 3"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "marimo-total",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": ["total = price * quantity\n", "total"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "marimo-tax",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": ["tax_rate = 0.2\n", "tax = total * tax_rate\n", "tax"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "marimo-summary",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "print(f\"{quantity} × {price} = {total}, plus {tax:.2f} tax = {total + tax:.2f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "marimo-independent",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "greeting = 'This cell reads nothing above, so it never re-runs.'\n",
        "greeting"
      ]
    }
  ],
